 ### Time and Memory Complexity
-*   **Time Complexity:** The method is iterative and progressive. Performance is measured in frame estimates per second. It does not have a fixed convergence time but improves with more frames [S1].
+*   **Time Complexity:** The method is iterative and progressive [S1]. Performance is measured in frame estimates per second [S1]. It does not have a fixed convergence time but improves with more frames [S1].
